<h2>1. What is Corpus Engine? {#what-is-corpus-engine}</h2>
<p>Corpus Engine is a cloud-based, AI-powered media assistant designed specifically for <strong>live church broadcasts</strong>. It listens to what the preacher or worship leader is saying in real time, and automatically:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Detects Bible scripture references</strong> and retrieves the full verse text instantly</li>
<li><strong>Identifies worship songs</strong> and fetches the complete lyrics from the internet</li>
<li><strong>Pushes content directly</strong> to your broadcast screens through Holyrics, vMix, or ProPresenter</li>
</ul>
<p>Instead of a media team member scrambling to type scriptures while the preacher is speaking, Corpus Engine does all of this automatically — in under one second.</p>
<hr>
<h2>2. Why Corpus Engine? The Productivity Advantage {#why-corpus-engine}</h2>
<h3>The Problem: How Most Churches Operate Today</h3>
<p>In a typical live broadcast setup, displaying a Bible verse on screen requires <strong>three or more people</strong> working together in a stressful, error-prone chain:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>The Listener</strong> — Someone has to carefully listen to the preacher and catch the exact scripture reference</li>
<li><strong>The Typist</strong> — Another person has to open Bible software, search for the verse, and type it out</li>
<li><strong>The Operator</strong> — A third person formats the text and pushes it to the broadcast screen</li>
</ol>
<p>This manual process typically takes <strong>45 to 60 seconds</strong> from the moment the preacher says a verse to when it finally appears on screen. By that time, the preacher has already moved on, and the congregation has missed the context.</p>
<h3>The Solution: How Corpus Engine Works</h3>
<p>With Corpus Engine, you need <strong>just one person</strong> (or even zero, with Auto-Push enabled):</p>
<ol>
<li>The preacher says <em>&quot;Let us turn to John chapter 3, verse 16&quot;</em></li>
<li>Corpus Engine&#39;s AI <strong>instantly detects</strong> the reference</li>
<li>The full verse text appears on your broadcast screen in <strong>under 1 second</strong></li>
</ol>
<p><img src="data:image/jpg;base64," alt="Workflow Comparison — Without vs With Corpus Engine"></p>
<h3>Key Benefits at a Glance</h3>
