<td>Open <strong>vMix</strong> on the broadcast computer and verify your Title input is loaded</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>Open <strong>Google Chrome</strong> and navigate to Corpus Engine</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td>Log in to your Corpus Engine account</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>Verify the <strong>&quot;Connected&quot;</strong> indicator shows green in the top bar</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7</td>
<td>Click <strong>⚙️ Settings</strong> and verify your Holyrics IP, Port, and Token are correct</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>8</td>
<td>Verify your vMix IP and Input number are correct</td>
<td>☐</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>9</td>
<td>Check that Chrome&#39;s <strong>Insecure Content</strong> is set to &quot;Allow&quot; (see Section 8)</td>
