<li>✅ <strong>Eliminates human error</strong> in scripture display</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Speeds up response time</strong> from 60 seconds to under 1 second</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Enhances broadcast quality</strong> with perfectly formatted, instant lower thirds</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Syncs your settings</strong> across any computer via the cloud</li>
<li>✅ <strong>Works with your existing tools</strong> — no need to replace Holyrics or vMix</li>
</ul>
<p>Welcome to effortless live broadcasting. ✨</p>
